{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"carcass_hare","model_identifier":"carcass_hare","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# carcass_hare\n\nHare carcass\n\n- Baked from `hare.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n"},"description":"# carcass_hare\n\nHare carcass\n\n- Baked from `hare.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"body","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,8.087,-4.5],"to":[2.5,13.087,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,10.587,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[14,7,19.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,7,6.5,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[19,7,24.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[7,7,13.5,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[24,0,29.0,6.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[29,0,34.0,6.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8defed44-dda3-56dc-b22e-7cc89670c3ff"},{"name":"haunch","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.0,7.587,1.0],"to":[3.0,14.087,7.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,10.5